    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator",
        "text": "Reunion has already passed the Causeway Bell."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator",
        "text": "Report from AU7: Reunion is also assembling in Ha Wan. I repeat, Reunion is currently assembling. This is AU7's mission briefing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator",
        "text": "Squad AO3 has eliminated the Reunion forces in Front Bay as planned. They are now pushing the remnants back towards the L.G.D. Headquarters."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator",
        "text": "All enemies in front of Scorpio Palace have been annihilated. Now retreating towards Charles Avenue to head to the rally point. This is Squad AL1's report, over."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator",
        "text": "These are the updates on Reunion's movements and each squad's progress."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator",
        "text": "Over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Understood."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Continue the operation. Our objective is to drive all Reunion forces into the designated area."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "If small groups of stragglers are seen in other districts, you are authorized to eliminate them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Try to draw them out if possible. Focus on avoiding casualties. We'll need to preserve our strength."
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Radio Operator",
        "text": "Yes ma'am."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Phew..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hmm? Another call?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
            "volume": 0.4
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "charactercutin",
        "params": {
            "widgetID": 1,
            "name": "char_308_swire_1#5",
            "style": "cutin",
            "fadestyle": "horiz_expand_center",
            "fadetime": 0.5,
            "offsetx": -300,
            "width": 200,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Hello, hello? Is this Ah Ch'en? Are you still there?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "What did you call me?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Ah Ch'en. You're done for! You're so dead for what happened at Paci Plaza. I heard it myself - you were the one who gave those orders!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Is that all you wanted to say?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Look, why did you reject Rhodes Island's help? Was it because you felt guilty?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "I don't recall you being a psychologist."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Don't worry, I'll help you make reparations."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Reparations?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Hehe, I can't tell you yet."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "But, you're so done for because of what you did!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "By the way, do you still remember that one restaurant in Sheung Wan?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Huh? Which one? Well, whichever one it is, they're all closed now!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Wait... are you trying to change the subject?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "The one with that absolutely divine steak sandwich."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Huh? Oh... OHH! I just remembered! The restaurant with a steak burger as big as your palms put side by side!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That's the one."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "I used to go there quite often while on my patrols... Get down! Who said you could stand up?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Aaah!!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "What was that place called again? Goodie Foodie?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Sounds about right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Aha, now I get it. You're going to treat me to a meal, aren't you? But why don't we go to some place a bit more high-class?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Your idea of 'high-class' is very different from mine."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Come on, I can foot the bill."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Miss S, do you really think I'm that kind of person?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Do you want to try calling me that again?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Sorry, I bit my tongue."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "You clearly did that on purpose!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Swire, I was just thinking... If we don't do a better job this time, we won't be able to face the locals."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Our businesses depend on Lungmen, and Lungmen also depends on them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "If you feel that way, you should stop running your mouth. The sooner we take down Reunion, the sooner you can treat me to brunch."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Seems like the fighting is pretty intense on your end as well?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Ah, it's fine. I can handle it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "???",
        "text": "Quick! They're about to get away!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "How annoying! Hey, hurry it up! We don't have all day!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Ah Ch'en! I want a steak, tomato, and egg burger!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "No problem."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Sorry for accidentally locking you up in the vault that other time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "You call that an accident? ! I know you did that on purpose! Whatever, it felt cathartic splashing water all over you this morning, so I guess we're even."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Hey, Ah Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hmm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Safety first. Don't throw your life away for the sake of what's immediately in front of you. Remember that there are lots of people who are counting on you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Hmph, is that so. Thanks for your advice."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Now that you're in front of the restaurant, that means you're almost at the L.G.D. Headquarters, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "That's right."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_empty",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Swire",
        "text": "Good luck."
    },
    {
