    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "All of you assembled here are the cream of the crop. As we speak, many of our colleagues are still out there fighting. But we have our own mission."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "The building in front of us used to be the symbol of Lungmen's safety \u2014 the embodiment of law and order, the heart of the L.G.D."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "But now, it has fallen into Reunion's hands, and has been tainted by conspiracy and warfare."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Some of you might see this as just another job. Some of you might be saddened, while others might be enraged."
    },
